The encoder copied an Rc per constant buffer and per sampler bind (two atomics each), and the device
mutex check was an out-of-line call twice per API call. Headless bench: +10% FPS, -12% process CPU.

diff --git a/src/d3d11/d3d11_multithread.cpp b/src/d3d11/d3d11_multithread.cpp
